Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D The Cozy Sleeping Bag chain: six objects across Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms, ending with a sleeping bag that gives up to 3% bonus experience, plus Student Fodder. Needs level 14, but the road runs through level 25-40 zones and enemy guards: level 20-25 is the sensible start. Running only, about 2.5 hours; flight points and the hearthstone are optional. \\ Steps 1 and 2 swap places by faction: the Horde start in the Barrens, the Alliance in Westfall. The other faction's start object does nothing for you. \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 20 Cozy Sleeping Bag]

-- Horde: Barrens first, then Westfall.
[A Horde] Leave Orgrimmar and follow the road to the Southfury bridge [G51,13.9 Durotar][G45.5,12 Durotar][G41,25 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar] \\ An elite Infernal may stand by the road west of Orgrimmar: give it room.
[A Horde][OC]Optional: get the [P Crossroads] flight path [G51.5,30.4 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Follow the Barrens road west and south past the Crossroads and Camp Taurajo [G61.8,20 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G52,30 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G45.5,66 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Search the Burned-Out Remains at the burnt tower and accept [QA79007 ... and that note you found] [G46.4,73.9 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Run back north to Ratchet [G45.5,66 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G63.8,38.8 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Take the boat to Booty Bay [G25.7,73.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Follow the Stranglethorn road north past Grom'gol into Duskwood [G38,50 Stranglethorn Vale][G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale][G38,4 Stranglethorn Vale] \\ Stranglethorn mobs are far above your level: stick to the road.
[A Horde][OC]Optional: get the [P Grom'gol] flight path [G32.5,29.3 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Follow the Duskwood road west into Westfall [G45,70 Duskwood][G20,48 Duskwood][G68,70 Westfall][G52,62 Westfall] \\ Duskwood mobs are above your level: stick to the road. Mor'Ladim (elite) walks the Raven Hill Cemetery north of the road.
[A Horde] Search the Burned-Out Remains at the Alexston Farmstead wreckage: [QT79007 ... and that note you found] [G37.4,50.7 Westfall] \\ Sentinel Hill (Alliance guards) is east at 56,50: keep clear.
[A Horde] Read the Nailed Plank beside it and accept [QA79192 Stepping Stones] [G37.4,50.8 Westfall]
[A Horde] Run back east through Duskwood to Grom'gol [G52,62 Westfall][G68,70 Westfall][G20,48 Duskwood][G45,70 Duskwood][G38,4 Stranglethorn Vale][G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale]
[A Horde] Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar [G51,13.9 Durotar]
[A Horde] Follow the road to the Southfury bridge and west through the Barrens to the Stonetalon pass [G45.5,12 Durotar][G41,25 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G61.8,20 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens]

-- Alliance: Westfall first, then the Barrens.
[A Alliance] Leave Stormwind and follow the road west through Elwynn into Westfall [G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest][G62,49 Westfall][G56,50 Westfall]
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Sentinel Hill] flight path [G56.6,52.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Search the Burned-Out Remains at the Alexston Farmstead wreckage and accept [QA79008 ... and that note you found] [G37.4,50.7 Westfall]
[A Alliance] Run back to Stormwind and the harbor pier [G56,50 Westfall][G62,49 Westfall][G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Auberdine [G30.5,40.9 Darkshore]
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Auberdine] flight path [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Follow the Darkshore road south into Ashenvale [G37,44 Darkshore][G41,40 Darkshore][G44,58 Darkshore][G44,76 Darkshore][G43,92 Darkshore]
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Astranaar] flight path [G34.5,48.0 Ashenvale]
[A Alliance] Follow the Ashenvale road past Astranaar to Talondeep Path [G28,14 Ashenvale][G27,36 Ashenvale][G35,48 Ashenvale][G39,61 Ashenvale][G42.5,71 Ashenvale] \\ Ashenvale mobs reach level 25+: stick to the road.
[A Alliance] Go through Talondeep Path and down the east side of Stonetalon into the Barrens [G78,42 Stonetalon Mountains][G79.5,60 Stonetalon Mountains][G84.2,72 Stonetalon Mountains][G81,78.5 Stonetalon Mountains][G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Grimtotem camps lie off the road: stick to it.
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Ratchet] flight path [G63.1,37.1 The Barrens] (neutral)
[A Alliance] Follow the Barrens road east past the Wailing Caverns and south, east of the Crossroads and Camp Taurajo [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G49.3,32.9 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58 The Barrens][G45.5,66 The Barrens] \\ The Crossroads and Camp Taurajo have Horde guards: keep east of them.
[A Alliance] Search the Burned-Out Remains at the burnt tower: [QT79008 ... and that note you found] [G46.4,73.9 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Read the Nailed Plank on the tower and accept [QA79192 Stepping Stones] [G46.4,73.8 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Run back north and west to the Stonetalon pass [G45.5,66 The Barrens][G47.5,58 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G49.3,32.9 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G35.5,27.5 The Barrens]

-- Both: Stonetalon Mountains.
Go through the pass and follow the road west, then north past Webwinder Path [G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains][G71,89 Stonetalon Mountains][G60.5,81.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G58,67.2 Stonetalon Mountains][G54,61.4 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Stonetalon mobs here are level 20-27: stick to the road.
[A Horde][OC]Optional: get the [P Sun Rock Retreat] flight path [G45.2,59.9 Stonetalon Mountains] (west of the road)
Leave the road on its west side where a path climbs into the hills, and follow it west to the abandoned camp [G52.2,53.4 Stonetalon Mountains][G51,52.4 Stonetalon Mountains][G48.8,54.2 Stonetalon Mountains][G43,54.1 Stonetalon Mountains]
Search the Pocket Litter on a box in the camp: [QT79192 Stepping Stones] and accept [QA79980 Scramble] [G40.8,52.6 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Rekindle at the firepit is optional, gives only Flint and Tinder, and players report the fire often cannot be clicked: skip it [QS80001 Rekindle].
Climb the hill north of the camp and drop from its edge to the Mound of Dirt below: [QT79980 Scramble] and accept [QA79974 Wet Job] [G39.6,49.8 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Do not overshoot the ledge.
Run back down the hill path to the road and south to the Barrens [G43,54.1 Stonetalon Mountains][G48.8,54.2 Stonetalon Mountains][G51,52.4 Stonetalon Mountains][G52.2,53.4 Stonetalon Mountains][G54,61.4 Stonetalon Mountains][G58,67.2 Stonetalon Mountains][G60.5,81.7 Stonetalon Mountains][G71,89 Stonetalon Mountains][G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains]

-- Horde: zeppelin to Tirisfal, then overland to Loch Modan.
[A Horde] Follow the Barrens road east to the Southfury bridge and on to the Orgrimmar zeppelin tower [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G61.8,20 The Barrens][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G41,25 Durotar][G45.5,12 Durotar][G51,13.9 Durotar]
[A Horde] Take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde] Follow the road west and south through Silverpine into Hillsbrad [G61.8,65 Tirisfal Glades][G49,70 Tirisfal Glades][G60,20 Silverpine Forest][G50,40 Silverpine Forest][G56,62 Silverpine Forest][G60,68 Silverpine Forest] \\ Son of Arugal (elite) can spawn at night in south Silverpine: run if you see him.
[A Horde][OC]Optional: get the [P Tarren Mill] flight path [G60.1,18.6 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Horde] Follow the Hillsbrad road east past Durnholde Keep to Thoradin's Wall and through the gate [G15,45 Hillsbrad Foothills][G35,48 Hillsbrad Foothills][G62,41 Hillsbrad Foothills][G83.7,60 Hillsbrad Foothills] \\ Southshore (Alliance guards) lies south of the road at 35,48: do not turn south. You come back here at the end.
[A Horde][OC]Optional: get the [P Hammerfall] flight path [G73.1,32.6 Arathi Highlands] (north of the road)
[A Horde] Follow the Arathi road east and south to Thandol Span [G20.5,30.5 Arathi Highlands][G26.3,50.1 Arathi Highlands][G45.2,58.4 Arathi Highlands][G56.6,61.8 Arathi Highlands][G67.8,73.6 Arathi Highlands][G57.6,83 Arathi Highlands][G49.2,97 Arathi Highlands] \\ Refuge Pointe (Alliance guards) is north of the crossing at 45,58. Witherbark elites roam the east: keep to the road.
[A Horde] Cross Thandol Span and follow the Wetlands road south to Dun Algaz [G51.3,10.1 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands] \\ Dark Iron elites hold Dun Modr just west of the road south of the bridge: keep east. \\ Wetlands mobs reach level 25-30, and Alliance Mountaineers guard Dun Algaz: run through, and if you die, take the corpse run into Loch Modan.

-- Alliance: boat to the Wetlands, then Loch Modan.
[A Alliance] Follow the Barrens road east and south to the Dustwallow road [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G49.3,32.9 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G62.7,39.7 The Barrens][G62.9,48 The Barrens][G62.8,53.6 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Follow the Dustwallow road along the north shore and south to Theramore [G53.5,10.7 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.5,38 Dustwallow Marsh][G66.8,48 Dustwallow Marsh][G71.7,56.7 Dustwallow Marsh] \\ Dustwallow mobs reach level 35+: stick to the road.
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Theramore] flight path [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Menethil Harbor [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Menethil Harbor] flight path [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Follow the Wetlands road east and south to Dun Algaz [G12.3,52.2 Wetlands][G22.4,48.7 Wetlands][G33.6,47.9 Wetlands][G39.2,35.1 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands] \\ Wetlands mobs reach level 25-30: stick to the road. Dark Iron elites hold Dun Modr west of the road near Thandol Span.
[A Alliance][OC]Optional: get the [P Thelsamar] flight path [G33.9,50.8 Loch Modan]

-- Both: Loch Modan and Thoradin's Wall.
Go through Dun Algaz and run north-east along the north shore onto the Stonewrought Dam [G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G39.2,15.1 Loch Modan][G43.6,10.8 Loch Modan][G47.9,12.1 Loch Modan]
Drop onto the carved heads on the dam's Wetlands side and click the Carved Figurine: [QT79974 Wet Job] and accept [QA79975 Eagle's Fist] [G49.4,12.9 Loch Modan] \\ Coming from the west, it is on the east-most of the three heads. [A Horde] Dwarf guards patrol the dam: be quick.
Run back to Dun Algaz and north through the Wetlands to Thandol Span \\ Dark Iron elites hold Dun Modr west of the road near the bridge: keep east. [G47.9,12.1 Loch Modan][G43.6,10.8 Loch Modan][G39.2,15.1 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G51.3,10.1 Wetlands]
Cross Thandol Span and follow the Arathi road north and west to Thoradin's Wall, through the gate into Hillsbrad [G49.2,97 Arathi Highlands][G57.6,83 Arathi Highlands][G67.8,73.6 Arathi Highlands][G56.6,61.8 Arathi Highlands][G45.2,58.4 Arathi Highlands][G26.3,50.1 Arathi Highlands][G20.5,30.5 Arathi Highlands][G83.7,60 Hillsbrad Foothills] \\ Witherbark elites roam the east: keep to the road. [A Alliance] Hammerfall (Horde guards) is far north-east: do not go there.
Turn left and follow the wall north to the fallen cart, then climb the cart onto the rubble and up the wall [G83.7,54.4 Hillsbrad Foothills][G88,47.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Go through the room in the wall and look out to the right: click the hanging Messenger Bag, [QT79975 Eagle's Fist] and accept [QA79976 This Must Be The Place] [G85.7,52.2 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Search the Hastily Rolled-Up Satchel under the bag: [QT79976 This Must Be The Place] for the Cozy Sleeping Bag [G85.7,52.2 Hillsbrad Foothills]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
